{% import "components/lightbox-gallery.njk" as lightboxC %}
{% if masonryGalleryDemo.source == "pexels" %}
<p>Six real architecture photos fetched live from Pexels, each keeping its own natural height, arranged with plain CSS multi-column layout — no JavaScript, no masonry library:</p>
{% else %}
<p>Pexels photos weren't available for this build (usually a missing <code>PEXELS_API_KEY</code>), so these are the local placeholder gradients, each a different height, arranged with plain CSS multi-column layout — no JavaScript, no masonry library:</p>
{% endif %}
<div class="masonry-gallery" data-lightbox-gallery>
  {% for item in masonryGalleryDemo.items %}
  {{ lightboxC.lightboxItem(item, "masonry-gallery__item") }}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
